dry weather + everyday use, this moisturizing hand crème helps keep hands soft, smooth + cared for throughout the day.</li></ul>$exseed$, updated_at = now() where part = $exseed$121-00-07$exseed$;
update public.media_kit_products set long_description = $exseed$<p>Indulge dry, thirsty skin with rich, concentrated moisture. Natural Inspirations Body Butter is an ultra-nourishing moisturizer formulated with shea butter, coconut oil, apricot kernel oil + our signature ExSeed® blend of cold-pressed pomegranate, cranberry, grape, carrot + black cumin seed oils.</p><p>Its creamy, decadent texture melts into skin to help soften rough, dry areas and replenish lasting moisture without leaving skin feeling weighed down. Ideal for arms, legs, elbows, knees + anywhere skin needs extra care, it leaves skin feeling smooth, supple + deeply conditioned.</p><p>The delightfully crisp blend of Agave nectar, fresh Citrus and delicate Pear will leave your skin deliciously scented.</p>$exseed$, benefits = $exseed$<ul><li><strong>INTENSE MOISTURE FOR DRY SKIN</strong>: Ultra-rich body butter delivers deep, concentrated hydration to help soften dry, rough skin and leave it feeling smooth, supple + comforted.</li><li><strong>CLEAN FRESH FRAGRANCE</strong>: The delightfully crisp blend of Agave nectar, fresh Citrus and delicate Pear will leave your skin deliciously scented.</li><li><strong>POWERED BY EXSEED®</strong>: Our signature blend of cold-pressed pomegranate, cranberry, grape, carrot + black cumin seed oils helps nourish, condition + replenish dry, thirsty skin.</li><li><strong>SHEA BUTTER + BOTANICAL OILS NOURISH SKIN</strong>: Rich shea butter, coconut oil + apricot kernel oil help soften rough areas and restore a smoother, more conditioned feel.</li><li><strong>RICH, CREAMY + INDULGENT</strong>: The decadent texture melts into skin, delivering luxurious moisture without leaving it feeling overly heavy or greasy.</li><li><strong>EXTRA CARE WHERE SKIN NEEDS IT MOST</strong>: Ideal for arms, legs, elbows, knees + other dry areas, this deeply moisturizing body butter helps keep skin soft, smooth + beautifully cared for.</li></ul>$exseed$, updated_at = now() where part = $exseed$131-00-07$exseed$;
