and crème helps keep hands soft, smooth + cared for throughout the day.</li></ul>$exseed$, updated_at = now() where part = $exseed$121-00-09$exseed$;
update public.media_kit_products set long_description = $exseed$<p>Give dry, hardworking hands the moisture they crave. Natural Inspirations Hand Crème is a rich, luxurious moisturizing hand cream formulated with shea butter, coconut oil, apricot kernel oil + our signature ExSeed® blend of cold-pressed pomegranate, cranberry, grape, carrot + black cumin seed oils.</p><p>The nourishing formula helps soften rough, dry skin and restore lasting moisture while absorbing beautifully for a smooth, silky finish that never feels overly heavy or greasy. Perfect for frequent handwashing, dry weather + everyday use, it leaves hands feeling soft, conditioned + cared for.</p><p>A sparkling scent of citrus aloft sea breezes of marine, jasmine, sandalwood and amber leave your skin soft, smooth + lightly fragranced, turning everyday hand care into a small moment of indulgence.</p>$exseed$, benefits = $exseed$<ul><li><strong>DEEP, LASTING HYDRATION: </strong>Rich, nourishing hand crème delivers concentrated moisture to help soften dry, rough hands and leave skin feeling smooth + comfortably hydrated.</li><li><strong>CLEAN FRESH FRAGRANCE:</strong> Sparkling grapefruit, bergamot + citrus mingle with fresh marine notes, soft florals + warm woods for a clean, breezy fragrance that lingers lightly on your skin.</li><li><strong>POWERED BY EXSEED®</strong>: Our signature blend of cold-pressed pomegranate, cranberry, grape, carrot + black cumin seed oils helps nourish, condition + replenish dry, hardworking hands.</li><li><strong>SHEA BUTTER + BOTANICAL OILS SOFTEN SKIN:</strong> Moisturizing shea butter, coconut oil + apricot kernel oil help smooth rough, dry skin and leave hands feeling supple + beautifully conditioned.</li><li><strong>RICH MOISTURE WITHOUT THE GREASE: </strong>This luxurious hand cream absorbs beautifully, delivering intensive moisture with a silky finish that feels soft + smooth, never heavy or greasy.</li><li><strong>MADE TO INDULGE DRY, HARDWORKING HANDS:</strong> Ideal for frequent handwashing, dry weather + everyday use, this moisturizing hand crème helps keep hands soft, smooth + cared for throughout the day.</li></ul>$exseed$, updated_at = now() where part = $exseed$120-00-05$exseed$;
update public.media_kit_products set long_description = $exseed$<p>Wrap skin in a silky veil of nourishing botanical oils. Natural Inspirations Dry Body Oil is formulated with apricot kernel oil + our signature ExSeed® blend of cold-pressed pomegranate, grape, cranberry, black cumin + carrot seed oils to soften, condition and replenish dry skin.</p><p>The lightweight formula glides effortlessly over skin and absorbs beautifully without the heavy, greasy feel of traditional body oils. Massage onto damp skin after bathing to help lock in moisture, or smooth over dry skin anytime it needs extra softness + radiance.</p><p>.Skin will feel luxuriously soft and lightly scented with the energizing scent of Eucalyptus, Rosemary + Mint.</p>$exseed$, benefits = $exseed$<ul><li><strong>SILKY MOISTURE + RADIANT SKIN</strong>: Nourishing body oil helps soften dry skin, replenish moisture + leave it smooth, supple and naturally glowing.</li><li><strong>CLEAN, FRESH FRAGRANCE:</strong> Refreshing eucalyptus, rosemary + cool mint blend with touches of citrus, lavender + soft woods for a fresh, aromatic scent that feels clean + invigorating.</li><li><strong>POWERED BY EXSEED®:</strong> Our signature blend of cold-pressed pomegranate, grape, cranberry, black cumin + carrot seed oils delivers antioxidant-rich botanical nourishment for beautifully conditioned skin.</li><li><strong>APRICOT KERNEL OIL SOFTENS + CONDITIONS:</strong> Naturally emollient apricot kernel oil helps smooth dry, rough skin while supporting a soft, supple feel.</li><li><strong>FAST-ABSORBING + NEVER GREASY:</strong> This lightweight dry oil absorbs beautifully into skin, delivering silky moisture without a heavy or oily residue.</li><li><strong>MULTI-USE MOISTURE FOR BODY, FACE + HAIR:</strong> Use on the body to lock in moisture, smooth lightly over the face as desired, or apply sparingly to hair for added softness + shine.</li></ul>$exseed$, updated_at = now() where part = $exseed$140-00-01$exseed$;
update public.media_kit_products set long_description = $exseed$<p>Wrap skin in a silky veil of nourishing botanical oils. Natural Inspirations Dry Body Oil is formulated with apricot kernel oil + our signature ExSeed® blend of cold-pressed pomegranate, grape, cranberry, black cumin + carrot seed oils to soften, condition and replenish dry skin.</p><p>The lightweight formula glides effortlessly over skin and absorbs beautifully without the heavy, greasy feel of traditional body oils. Massage onto damp skin after bathing to help lock in moisture, or smooth over dry skin anytime it needs extra softness + radiance. Skin will feel luxuriously soft and lightly scented with the refreshing tang of ruby red Grapefruit + sweet juicy Bergamot.</p>$exseed$, benefits = $exseed$<ul><li><strong>SILKY MOISTURE + RADIANT SKIN:</strong> Nourishing body oil helps soften dry skin, replenish moisture + leave it smooth, supple and naturally glowing.</li><li><strong>CLEAN, FRESH FRAGRANCE:</strong> Crisp grapefruit + bright bergamot blend with sparkling citrus and soft musk for a fresh, uplifting fragrance that feels clean + effortlessly wearable</li><li><strong>POWERED BY EXSEED®</strong>: Our signature blend of cold-pressed pomegranate, grape, cranberry, black cumin + carrot seed oils delivers antioxidant-rich botanical nourishment for beautifully conditioned skin.</li><li><strong>APRICOT KERNEL OIL SOFTENS + CONDITIONS</strong>: Naturally emollient apricot kernel oil helps smooth dry, rough skin while supporting a soft, supple feel.</li><li><strong>FAST-ABSORBING + NEVER GREASY: </strong>This lightweight dry oil absorbs beautifully into skin, delivering silky moisture without a heavy or oily residue.</li><li><strong>MULTI-USE MOISTURE FOR BODY, FACE + HAIR</strong>: Use on the body to lock in moisture, smooth lightly over the face as desired, or apply sparingly to hair for added softness + shine.</li></ul>$exseed$, updated_at = now() where part = $exseed$140-00-04$exseed$;
update public.media_kit_products set long_description = $exseed$<p>Indulge dry, hardworking hands with the moisture they crave. Natural Inspirations Hand Crème is a rich, luxurious moisturizing hand cream formulated with shea butter, coconut oil, apricot kernel oil + our signature ExSeed® blend of cold-pressed pomegranate, cranberry, grape, carrot + black cumin seed oils.</p><p>The nourishing formula helps soften rough, dry skin and restore lasting moisture while absorbing beautifully for a smooth, silky finish that never feels overly heavy or greasy. Perfect for frequent handwashing, dry weather + everyday use, it leaves hands feeling soft, conditioned + cared for. Essential oils from crisp eucalyptus, soothing rosemary and stimulating peppermint designed to turn everyday hand care into a small moment of indulgence.</p>$exseed$, benefits = $exseed$<ul><li><strong>DEEP, LASTING HYDRATION</strong>: Rich, nourishing hand crème delivers concentrated moisture to help soften dry, rough hands and leave skin feeling smooth + comfortably hydrated.</li><li><strong>CLEAN FRESH FRAGRANCE</strong>: Refreshing eucalyptus, rosemary + cool mint blend with touches of citrus, lavender + soft woods for a fresh, aromatic scent that feels clean + invigorating.</li><li><strong>POWERED BY EXSEED®</strong>: Our signature blend of cold-pressed pomegranate, cranberry, grape, carrot + black cumin seed oils helps nourish, condition + replenish dry, hardworking hands.</li><li><strong>SHEA BUTTER + BOTANICAL OILS SOFTEN SKIN:</strong> Moisturizing shea butter, coconut oil + apricot kernel oil help smooth rough, dry skin and leave hands feeling supple + beautifully conditioned.</li><li><strong>RICH MOISTURE WITHOUT THE GREASE: </strong>This luxurious hand cream absorbs beautifully, delivering intensive moisture with a silky finish that feels soft + smooth, never heavy or greasy.</li><li><strong>MADE TO INDULGE DRY, HARDWORKING HANDS:</strong> Ideal for frequent handwashing, dry weather + everyday use, this moisturizing hand crème helps keep hands soft, smooth + cared for throughout the day.</li></ul>$exseed$, updated_at = now() where part = $exseed$120-00-01$exseed$;
update public.media_kit_products set long_description = $exseed$<p>Wrap skin in a silky veil of nourishing botanical oils. Natural Inspirations Dry Body Oil is formulated with apricot kernel oil + our signature ExSeed® blend of cold-pressed pomegranate, grape, cranberry, black cumin + carrot seed oils to soften, condition and replenish dry skin.</p><p>The lightweight formula glides effortlessly over skin and absorbs beautifully without the heavy, greasy feel of traditional body oils. Massage onto damp skin after bathing to help lock in moisture, or smooth over dry skin anytime it needs extra softness + radiance.</p><p>Skin is left feeling luxuriously soft, smooth + lightly scented with juicy pear + fresh citrus.</p>$exseed$, benefits = $exseed$<ul><li><strong>SILKY MOISTURE + RADIANT SKIN:</strong> Nourishing body oil helps soften dry skin, replenish moisture + leave it smooth, supple and naturally glowing.</li><li><strong>CLEAN, FRESH FRAGRANCE:</strong> Juicy pear + fresh citrus blend with crisp green notes, delicate florals + soft woods for a bright, refreshing fragrance with just a touch of sweetness.</li><li><strong>POWERED BY EXSEED®:</strong> Our signature blend of cold-pressed pomegranate, grape, cranberry, black cumin + carrot seed oils delivers antioxidant-rich botanical nourishment for beautifully conditioned skin.</li><li><strong>APRICOT KERNEL OIL SOFTENS + CONDITIONS:</strong> Naturally emollient apricot kernel oil helps smooth dry, rough skin while supporting a soft, supple feel.</li><li><strong>FAST-ABSORBING + NEVER GREASY:</strong> This lightweight dry oil absorbs beautifully into skin, delivering silky moisture without a heavy or oily residue.</li><li><strong>MULTI-USE MOISTURE FOR BODY, FACE + HAIR:</strong> Use on the body to lock in moisture, smooth lightly over the face as desired, or apply sparingly to hair for added softness + shine.</li></ul>$exseed$, updated_at = now() where part = $exseed$140-00-07$exseed$;
update public.media_kit_products set benefits = $exseed$<ul><li><strong>DEEP LASTING HYDRATION:</strong> This nourishing hand + body lotion replenishes dry skin with rich, skin-loving moisture, leaving it soft, smooth + comfortably hydrated.</li><li><strong>POWERED BY EXSEED®:</strong> Our signature antioxidant blend of cold-pressed pomegranate, cranberry, grape, carrot + black cumin seed oils helps nourish, condition + restore dry, thirsty skin.</li><li><strong>COCONUT OIL + BOTANICAL OILS SOFTEN SKIN</strong>: Moisturizing coconut oil, shea butter + apricot kernel oil help smooth rough, dry areas and leave skin feeling supple + beautifully conditioned.</li><li><strong>SILKY, EVERYDAY MOISTURE:</strong> The luxurious lotion glides easily over skin and absorbs beautifully, delivering rich hydration without an overly heavy feel.</li><li><strong>HEAD-TO-TOE DRY SKIN CARE: </strong>Perfect for hands, arms, legs, elbows, knees + feet, this daily moisturizing lotion helps keep dry skin soft, smooth + cared for.</li><li><strong>CLEAN FRESH FRAGRANCE</strong>: An uplifting medley of intoxicating citruses with sweet Bergamot, juicy Orange, fresh Lemon and crisp, ruby red Grapefruit. A clean, classic essence that is positively addicting!</li></ul>$exseed$, updated_at = now() where part = $exseed$110-00-04$exseed$;
update public.media_kit_products set long_description = $exseed$<p>Indulge dry, thirsty skin with rich, concentrated moisture. Natural Inspirations Body Butter is an ultra-nourishing moisturizer formulated with shea butter, coconut oil, apricot kernel oil + our signature ExSeed® blend of cold-pressed pomegranate, cranberry, grape, carrot + black cumin seed oils.</p><p>Its creamy, decadent texture melts into skin to help soften rough, dry areas and replenish lasting moisture without leaving skin feeling weighed down. Ideal for arms, legs, elbows, knees + anywhere skin needs extra care, it leaves skin feeling smooth, supple + deeply conditioned.</p><p>A revitalizing, long-lasting moisture treatment with essential oils from eucalyptus, rosemary + mint leave your skin feeling soothed and refreshed.</p>$exseed$, benefits = $exseed$<ul><li><strong>INTENSE MOISTURE FOR DRY SKIN</strong>: Ultra-rich body butter delivers deep, concentrated hydration to help soften dry, rough skin and leave it feeling smooth, supple + comforted.</li><li><strong>CLEAN FRESH FRAGRANCE:</strong> Refreshing eucalyptus, rosemary + cool mint blend with touches of citrus, lavender + soft woods for a fresh, aromatic scent that feels clean + invigorating.</li><li><strong>POWERED BY EXSEED®:</strong> Our signature blend of cold-pressed pomegranate, cranberry, grape, carrot + black cumin seed oils helps nourish, condition + replenish dry, thirsty skin.</li><li><strong>SHEA BUTTER + BOTANICAL OILS NOURISH SKIN:</strong> Rich shea butter, coconut oil + apricot kernel oil help soften rough areas and restore a smoother, more conditioned feel.</li><li><strong>RICH, CREAMY + INDULGENT:</strong> The decadent texture melts into skin, delivering luxurious moisture without leaving it feeling overly heavy or greasy.</li><li><strong>EXTRA CARE WHERE SKIN NEEDS IT MOST:</strong> Ideal for arms, legs, elbows, knees + other dry areas, this deeply moisturizing body butter helps keep skin soft, smooth + beautifully cared for.</li></ul>$exseed$, updated_at = now() where part = $exseed$131-00-01$exseed$;
