ed for.</li></ul>$exseed$, updated_at = now() where part = $exseed$130-00-01$exseed$;
update public.media_kit_products set long_description = $exseed$Give dry, hardworking hands the moisture they crave. Natural Inspirations Hand Crème is a rich, luxurious moisturizing hand cream formulated with shea butter, coconut oil, apricot kernel oil + our signature ExSeed® blend of cold-pressed pomegranate, cranberry, grape, carrot + black cumin seed oils.<p>The nourishing formula helps soften rough, dry skin and restore lasting moisture while absorbing beautifully for a smooth, silky finish that never feels overly heavy or greasy. Perfect for frequent handwashing, dry weather + everyday use, it leaves hands feeling soft, conditioned + cared for.</p><p>An intoxicating scent of fresh cypress, eucalyptus + crisp fir leave your skin soft, smooth + deliciously fragranced.</p>$exseed$, benefits = $exseed$<ul><li><strong>DEEP, LASTING HYDRATION</strong>: Rich, nourishing hand crème delivers concentrated moisture to help soften dry, rough hands and leave skin feeling smooth + comfortably hydrated.</li><li><strong>CLEAN FRESH FRAGRANCE</strong>: Fresh, aromatic woods mingle with sophisticated green + earthy notes for a clean, modern fragrance that feels grounded, refined + subtly gender-neutral.</li><li><strong>POWERED BY EXSEED®</strong>: Our signature blend of cold-pressed pomegranate, cranberry, grape, carrot + black cumin seed oils helps nourish, condition + replenish dry, hardworking hands.</li><li><strong>SHEA BUTTER + BOTANICAL OILS SOFTEN SKIN:</strong> Moisturizing shea butter, coconut oil + apricot kernel oil help smooth rough, dry skin and leave hands feeling supple + beautifully conditioned.</li><li><strong>RICH MOISTURE WITHOUT THE GREASE</strong>: This luxurious hand cream absorbs beautifully, delivering intensive moisture with a silky finish that feels soft + smooth, never heavy or greasy.</li><li><strong>MADE TO INDULGE DRY, HARDWORKING HANDS:</strong> Ideal for frequent handwashing, dry weather + everyday use, this ultra-moisturizing hand crème helps keep hands soft, smooth + cared for throughout the day.</li></ul>$exseed$, updated_at = now() where part = $exseed$121-00-08$exseed$;
